  "slug": "twenty-years-later",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/5456_twenty-years-later.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Recently, a mother in Shanghai was so angry that her daughter didn't do her homework seriously that she went crazy. However, the mother's anger made her parents very happy.",
    "It turns out that 23 years ago, this mother's father encountered the same thing when he was helping her with her homework. Her daughter didn't do her homework seriously, so he wrote a letter to her. The letter said: One day you will also become a parent. In the future, your child will have the same problem as you do now. What will you do?"
  ],
  "english_full": "Recently, a mother in Shanghai was so angry that her daughter didn't do her homework seriously that she went crazy. However, the mother's anger made her parents very happy.\n\nIt turns out that 23 years ago, this mother's father encountered the same thing when he was helping her with her homework. Her daughter didn't do her homework seriously, so he wrote a letter to her. The letter said: One day you will also become a parent. In the future, your child will have the same problem as you do now. What will you do?",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Неда́вно ма́ть в Шанха́е была́ так злá, что её до́чка не сделала свои́ дома́шние зада́ния серьёзно, что она сошла́ с ума. Одна́ко гнев ма́тери сделал её роди́телей са́мыми счастли́выми.",
    "Ока́залось, что 23 го́да наза́д, ба́тюшка э́той ма́тери встре́тил ту́ же саму́ю вещь, когда он помо́гал ей с её дома́шними зада́ниями. Её до́чка не сделала свои́ дома́шние зада́ния серьёзно, поэтому он напи́сал ей письмо́. В письме́ гово́рилось: Одна́жды ты тоже станешь роди́телем. В бу́дущем твой ребёнок будет имéть ту́ же пробле́му, что и ты сейча́с. Что́ ты будешь де́лать?"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Nedávno mát' v Shankháe bylá tak zlá, chto yéyo dóchka ne sdelala svói domáshnie zadániya ser'yozno, chto ona soshlá s uma. Odnáko gnev máteri sdelal yéyo rodítelei sámymi shchastlívymi.",
    "Okázalos', chto 23 góda nazad, bátyushka étoi máteri vstret́il tú zhe samuiu veshch', kogda on pomógal ei s yéi domáshnimi zadániyami. Yéyo dóchka ne sdelala svói domáshnie zadániya ser'yozno, poetomu on napísal ei pismó. V pismé govorílos': Odnázhdy ty tozhe stanésh' rodítelem. V búdushchem tvoy rebyónok budet imét' tú zhe problému, chto i ty seichas. Chtó ty budesh' délat'?"
  ],
