      "id": "story_5456_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Неда́вно ма́ть в Шанха́е была́ так злá, что её до́чка не сделала свои́ дома́шние зада́ния серьёзно, что она сошла́ с ума.",
      "text_en": "Recently, a mother in Shanghai was so angry that her daughter didn't do her homework seriously that she went crazy.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Nedávno\" data-defn=\"недавно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Неда́вно</span><rt>Nedávno</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mát&#x27;\" data-defn=\"мать\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ма́ть</span><rt>mát&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Shankháe\" data-defn=\"шанхае\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Шанха́е</span><rt>Shankháe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bylá\" data-defn=\"была\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">была́</span><rt>bylá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tak\" data-defn=\"так\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">так</span><rt>tak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zlá\" data-defn=\"злá\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">злá</span><rt>zlá</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">её</span><rt>eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóchka\" data-defn=\"дочка\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́чка</span><rt>dóchka</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sdelala\" data-defn=\"сделала\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сделала</span><rt>sdelala</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"svoí\" data-defn=\"свои\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">свои́</span><rt>svoí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"domáshnie\" data-defn=\"домашние\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">дома́шние</span><rt>domáshnie</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zadániya\" data-defn=\"задания\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зада́ния</span><rt>zadániya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ser&#x27;yozno\" data-defn=\"серьёзно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">серьёзно</span><rt>ser&#x27;yozno</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ona\" data-defn=\"она\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">она</span><rt>ona</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"soshlá\" data-defn=\"сошла\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сошла́</span><rt>soshlá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"uma\" data-defn=\"ума\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ума</span><rt>uma</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Nedávno mát' v Shankháe bylá tak zlá, chto eyo dóchka ne sdelala svoí domáshnie zadániya ser'yozno, chto ona soshlá s uma.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.42,
