      "text_en": "Her daughter didn't do her homework seriously, so he wrote a letter to her.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Eyo\" data-defn=\"её\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Её</span><rt>Eyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóchka\" data-defn=\"дочка\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́чка</span><rt>dóchka</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"не\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">не</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sdelala\" data-defn=\"сделала\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сделала</span><rt>sdelala</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"svoí\" data-defn=\"свои\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">свои́</span><rt>svoí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"domáshnie\" data-defn=\"домашние\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">дома́шние</span><rt>domáshnie</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zadániya\" data-defn=\"задания\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зада́ния</span><rt>zadániya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ser&#x27;yozno\" data-defn=\"серьёзно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">серьёзно</span><rt>ser&#x27;yozno</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"poetomu\" data-defn=\"поэтому\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">поэтому</span><rt>poetomu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"on\" data-defn=\"он\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">он</span><rt>on</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"napísal\" data-defn=\"написал\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">напи́сал</span><rt>napísal</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ey\" data-defn=\"ей\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ей</span><rt>ey</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pis&#x27;mó\" data-defn=\"письмо\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">письмо́</span><rt>pis&#x27;mó</rt></ruby>.",
