      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"V\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">В</span><rt>V</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pis&#x27;mé\" data-defn=\"письме\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">письме́</span><rt>pis&#x27;mé</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"govórilos&#x27;\" data-defn=\"говорилось\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">гово́рилось</span><rt>govórilos&#x27;</rt></ruby>: <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Odnázhdy\" data-defn=\"однажды\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Одна́жды</span><rt>Odnázhdy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ty\" data-defn=\"ты\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ты</span><rt>ty</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tozhe\" data-defn=\"тоже\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">тоже</span><rt>tozhe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stanesh&#x27;\" data-defn=\"станешь\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">станешь</span><rt>stanesh&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rodítelem\" data-defn=\"родителем\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">роди́телем</span><rt>rodítelem</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "V pis'mé govórilos': Odnázhdy ty tozhe stanesh' rodítelem.",
      "start": 23.19,
      "end": 26.19,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "story_5456_p1_c3",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 3,
